==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr}} {{term|grandiose|lang=fr}}, from {{etyl|it}} {{term|grandioso|lang=it}}, from {{etyl|la}} {{term|grandis||great, grand|lang=la}} (English {{term|grand|lang=en}}).

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# [[large]] and [[impressive]], in [[size]], [[scope]] or [[extent]]For example: "The phallus was grandiose in its magnificence".
# [[pompous]] or [[pretentious]]

